  m_text: "Hi there, young beekeeper! I'm <b>Pollie</b>, your bee guide.\n\nYou're
    going to build a hive, collect pollen, make honey, and survive the cold winter.
    The planet needs healthy bees \u2014 and that means <b>you</b>!"
